# CiteQuire — Frontend Environment Configuration
# When deployed together on Vercel as a multi-service project, leave this empty or unset!
# In that mode, the frontend calls relative '/api' endpoints, which Vercel rewrites to the backend service.
# If connecting to an external standalone backend:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.citequire.example.com
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
